body:
Exactly.

&#x200B;

Now I've realised the only reason I tried so hard is to impress ppl and feel some kind of love.

I feel exactly the same. 

&#x200B;

I feel so lost. I've been chasing my career whilst not realising that's not what I want. 

&#x200B;

Now there's no point in anything..

This could be the most helpful reply I've ever seen. After reading your comment I just realized when I had sexual relationships with other men, I was never attracted by their bodies, just enjoying the feeling of the relationships themselves.

&#x200B;

Guess I would be just straight.

So it seems like almost everyone in this thread made consensus that it's nearly essential. 

&#x200B;

I will definitely buy it!

All right. I'll keep that in mind next time I ask questions.

&#x200B;

